OL,4,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,5,     GEdith Bowman presents a weekly
OL,6,     Gcompendium of distinguished film
OL,7,     Gscores and soundtrack
OL,8,     Gcompositions - joined this week
OL,9,     Gby composers Sheridan Tongue and
OL,10,     GKathryn Tickell.
OL,11,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,12,     GJess Gillam swaps favourite music
OL,13,     Gwith film composer David Arnold.
OL,14,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,15,     GA dreamlike tale of love and
OL,16,     Gfate, wrapped in Debussy's
OL,17,     Ghypnotic harmonies. This
OL,18,     Gperformance with the BBC Scottish
OL,19,     GSymphony Orchestra brings
OL,20,     GDebussy's astonishing score to
OL,21,     Glife.
